  "text": "\r\n\t\t Voting Machine | Bow, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Our Community   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business in Bow   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk & Tax Collector \nElections & Town Meeting \nVoting Machine \r\nVoting Machine\t\t \r\nVotingWorks \nThe Town of Bow utilizes  VotingWorks . On the VotingWorks ballot, the voter fills in an oval which is placed next to a candidate's name. After voting, the voter places the ballot in an optical scanning machine which will read all votes cast on that ballot. \r\n\t\t\t How to Change a Party \r\n\t\t\t How to Register to Vote \r\n\t\t\t  Supervisors of the Checklist \r\n\t\t\t Vote by Absentee Ballot \r\n\t\t\t Voting Machine \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Permitting \r\n\t\t\t Elections and Town Meeting \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me® \r\n\t\t\t GIS & Tax Maps \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Bow \n10 Grandview Road \nBow, NH 03304 \nPhone:  603-223-3900 \nStaff Directory \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Baker Free Library \n         Bow Schools \n         Employment Opportunities \n         Motor Vehicle Registration \n         Parks and Recreation \n         Send Us Comments \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Site Map \n         Mission \n         Accessibility \n         Privacy \n         Copyright Notices \n         Powered by CivicPlus® \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n     Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
